{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18mini_level_act18mini_st03","groupId":"act18mini","stageId":null,"title":"錯身","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18mini/level_act18mini_st03.txt","sourceHash":"2c480b796535481f1be898bc9ac1fce5726cf6510788632cff4f9fe4ed0e9053","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g1_lentiavenue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧利，跟緊我……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不願讓我抱著，就必須自己緊緊跟上。抓住我的衣服，知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽沒辦法牽著你的手……我的手上都是汗水，會滑掉的！所以，你一定要抓緊我的衣服。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柯林，柯林！你在哪裡？我們到底能不能出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實在不行，我們還是先躲回家裡吧！孩子這麼小，要怎麼跟著我們逃命呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柯林——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快來，我找到一條路！典範軍進城後，負責看守我們的那些魔族佬也都被引開了，只要不遇到爆炸——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“只要不遇到爆炸”！雜貨店的施瓦爾背著家當跑出來，只是在散發紅光的地方摔了一跤……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一個巴掌大的傷口，身上的血卻都流乾了，你忘了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不，是被“抽”乾了……那樣的東西真的只是爆炸嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是因為他的傷口一直都沒癒合！只要我們小心一點，不要受傷也不要流血，就不會有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，現在絕不能往回走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才炸開的地方離我們這裡不超過兩百公尺，比起莫名其妙死在半路上，我寧願回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柯林，你的奶奶還在城裡啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……往回走只會更危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人能確定封鎖區內的薩卡茲是不是全都被調離了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你從外面進來，是典範軍？你們是來幫我們的嗎？求求你，救救我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……抱歉，我不是典範軍，我和他們沒有關係，也不為救人而來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來倫蒂尼姆，只為了找一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找誰？你的鞋子都磨破了，而且現在來倫蒂尼姆，還能找到誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是典範軍，你只是一個和我們相同的可憐人。柯林，我們往回走吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人重重地嘆息，再次謹慎地打量四周。\n時隔多年，他再次作為配鏡師來到倫蒂尼姆。這座城市如今的樣貌，就像在工坊的熱氣中舉起鏡片查驗，畫面模糊而失真。\n等到終於看清，映入眼簾的僅剩動蕩。要在這樣的混亂中準確找到一個行蹤詭譎、不知面貌的存在並非易事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您有想要的東西嗎？我把我身上所有值錢的東西都給您，能不能求您帶我們出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您獨自進入封鎖區卻毫髮無傷，這代表您一定知道安全的路。我請求您……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"瘦小的男子低頭摸遍身上所有的口袋，又從背包裡掏出幾塊麵包，試圖塞到諾威爾手裡。一旁的女性也連忙從身上掏出零碎的錢幣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"諾威爾沒有伸手去接。他搖了搖頭，知道眼前三人的未來與路旁那些血已乾涸的屍體僅有一線之隔。\n自己站在那條纖細的隔牆之後，從來都是這樣旁觀。\n他曾經伸出過雙手，可僅靠這一雙手，無法挽救所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柯林，我們走吧，他不會答應的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒有其他的辦法了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……雖然我不是典範軍，但我知道他們的駐紮地點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以帶你們去典範軍的據點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！謝謝、謝謝您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"僅此而已，其他的我也幫不上忙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好，已經夠好了，我們都跟您走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柯林，那你的奶奶呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等這些事情結束後，我們會回來接她的。魔族佬再怎麼殘忍，也不至於對療養院裡手無寸鐵的老人下手——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我帶你們出去，至於之後如何……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就只能靠你們自己了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，這樣就夠了。謝謝您，好心的先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不用。牽好孩子，跟在我身後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這邊走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g3_fogblockadestreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就從這裡繼續往前，一直走到城牆下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城牆下有處被轟炸出來的空洞，有部分典範軍正駐紮在那附近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再往外，應該是公爵聯軍的隊伍。你們也可以自己選擇去向誰求助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您呢，您去哪裡？聽您這麼說，似乎不會繼續跟我們一起走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在剛才救了我們的命。雖然我不明白是怎麼做到的，但至少讓我們也為您做些什麼吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，傷口已經癒合了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算——就算您有多麼天賦異稟，那些炮火對您也不會比對我們更加仁慈。我覺得您應該和我們一起走……您也是維多利亞人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不，我只是……我只是已經來到了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須找到那個人，在那之前沒有理由停下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽到您一直說要找人，請問您究竟在找誰呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這不是她第一次問這個問題。但這是一路以來第一次，她聽見眼前男人的回答有了平靜以外的情緒。\n他身上許多對常人來說足以致死的傷口都已開始癒合。湧出的鮮血瞬間就能止息，連薩卡茲的法陣也影響不了這具身體。\n只有疼痛始終存在。即使如此，他仍用力握緊了拳頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我在找……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給予我這個“天賦”的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g1_lentiavenue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"先生……先生！我們現在應該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往這邊走。我來掩護你們，儘量趕在下一波炮擊之前撤離——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓——讓開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老子今天一定要從這個鬼地方出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都別擋路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請回到後面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在應該讓老人與孩子先撤離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在放什麼屁——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自救軍的疏散路線是最安全的，如果你堅持獨自離開……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"匆忙的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……請問你是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？我是倫蒂尼姆自救軍的領袖，你可以叫我克洛維希婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說在這片區域裡有人協助市民撤離，感謝你提供的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，自救軍會接手撤離行動。你的使命結束了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我依然可以幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這很危險，我們不能平白要求你以身涉險交換他人的生路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自救軍無法許諾你任何回報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們甚至沒有什麼時間可以討論……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長話短說，就當作我受到了某種詛咒吧，不必顧及我的安全。讓我來掩護你們，幫助更多的人撤離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正我也需要在這裡，繼續尋找那個人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g4_fogblockadestreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一支小隊也已經過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個自救軍領袖……克洛維希婭呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"諾威爾四下張望，終於決定抓住一個外表看似是工人的男子，即使他只是從自己身前匆匆路過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，請問——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……抱歉，我沒注意到你另一隻手上有傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以幫你治療。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，有什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問你有沒有見到自救軍的領袖，克洛維希婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也帶著幾支被疏散的市民隊伍，先前兵分兩路之後，我們約定在這裡會合，從那之後我就再也沒見過她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶來的人早就分開安置了，至於她本人，不出意外應該還在安排最後的撤離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我也不能肯定，畢竟大家都有自己的要事得處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她早就到了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你們的撤離路線不僅更安全，也更快速。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是更瞭解地下部分的倫蒂尼姆，這並不代表絕對的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛維希婭需要親自指揮，以協助市民躲開剩餘薩卡茲傭兵的襲擊，如果你不怕魔族佬的陷阱，或許回封鎖區後能找到她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你也帶了不少人出來，應該幫得上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——先生！好心的先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問您看見奧利了嗎？就是我那個紅色頭髮的、不愛說話的孩子，身高只到我的膝蓋，您有看見嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的孩子，他不見了……他走失了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧利——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死！他到底跑去哪裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他一直在說你的奶奶，柯林，或許……或許他也不放心……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這附近都找過了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯、沒錯，都找過了！一起過來的人們也都在幫忙尋找，可是再往前過去，沒找過的地方就只剩下封鎖區了，這……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"封鎖區對我來說和其他地方沒有差別，我可以去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛維希婭——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴她我已經安全把人帶過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你一起去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你們留在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，我是說克洛維希婭回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看，她懷裡還抱著一個紅色頭髮的孩子——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——什麼？在哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"眾人抬頭，想要順著那人所指的方向望去——\n變故就是在此時發生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——所有人都退後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是奧利！她抱著奧利！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要過去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"諾威爾只來得及伸手抓住失控的女人。\n目之所及，異常的紅光閃爍，塌陷的地表如血口歙張，瞬間吞沒了自救軍的領袖。\n無數目光拋向眼前不斷震顫的大地中心，直至最後一刻，處於震央的人仍緊緊地摟著懷中的孩童。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"與往常無二的煙塵逐漸散去，似乎也象徵萬事萬物又短暫歸於寂靜。\n此地的人已經歷過無數次相同的離別，它的結果從不因罹難者的身分而有任何改變。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g4_fogblockadestreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳……咳咳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，先不要過去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"二次爆炸，或僅是餘震，曾在相似的情況下反覆上演。諾威爾知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……奧利……！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們儘快展開搜救！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先、先生，是您！您還在這裡！求您，求您幫幫奧利——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不怕那些魔族佬的陷阱，您的恢復速度很快，又很勇敢，那您是不是至少可以、可以把他帶回來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他還，那麼小……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"諾威爾其人，一生少有能夠完全控制的東西，漫長的生命帶來汪洋般的龐大記憶，正因如此，他無法做到隨意採擷。\n就像已邁入老年的普通人一樣，他也常常因為情景的重疊而陷入恍惚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g4_swamp_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就到這裡吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"送到這裡就可以了嗎？您真的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……不繼續留下來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他還，那麼小……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我最小的孩子，他甚至還不會叫您爺爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經太久了，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本應更早就追隨你的母親而去，卻等到現在，等到你的臉龐變得比我這個父親更加蒼老。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一事無成，卻總是留戀，我已經躊躇太久，久到對孩子們而言，我只是一個陌生人罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只有一個辦法可以結束這注定成為局外人的命運……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那現在就是使用它的時刻了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g4_fogblockadestreet_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"諾威爾望向爆炸和塌陷發生的位置。恍惚中，土石磚塊組成的空洞陡然變為百年前的某處昏黑沼澤。\n也是在這樣的一個清晨，耳邊響起近似的挽留或哀求。那時他固執地選擇了拒絕，接著便踏上了注定失敗的求死之路，而這次……\n他不會做出同樣的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……克洛維希婭掉下去之前，保護了那個孩子的頭部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就代表奧利或許可以活下來，但在得到確認之前，這只是一種猜測，所以……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我會下去，找到他們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"諾威爾按照自救軍的指引，試圖從地下進入廢墟，又倚仗體質和常年遊走獲得的經驗持續前進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"向西，三百公尺左右……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g17_wunderpass"},{"type":"narration","text":"他的步履不曾停歇，輕巧而迅速地走著，直到眼前出現有別於方才的景象。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在異族法陣啟動後的痕跡周圍，由塌陷處形成的石堆旁，一個紅髮的孩子安靜地躺著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（輕柔的呼吸聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他快步向前，將孩子抱起來摟在懷中，感覺到孩子小小的胸腔隨著呼吸的頻率起伏。\n如果不是頭髮上那些灰燼和碎石，這個孩子看起來甚至安穩得彷彿還睡在柔軟床鋪之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有嚴重外傷，應該只是昏迷。被獨自留在這裡，但不是直接墜落……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"趕上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"甚至克洛維希婭可能也在附近，她把奧利放下了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"克洛維希婭！你在前面嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"能聽見的話，就敲擊你身邊堅硬物體的表面——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"克洛維希婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你能……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"幾步之後，他直接面對了真相。\n半身被深埋於石塊之中的自救軍領袖已經失去了意識。\n年輕領袖的雙眼以一種自然而輕柔的方式閉合，她將永遠安眠於這個地底之中嗎？\n數秒前墜落時的痛苦，最後留下的竟然只有平靜，這令諾威爾不禁思索——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"克洛維希婭！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_5"},{"type":"narration","text":"因餘震落下的碎石，彷彿雨後羽獸驟然抖落一身潮濕的水點，急促，分散，令人猝不及防。\n諾威爾甚至來不及上前確認克洛維希婭是否仍有呼吸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不……"},{"type":"narration","text":"為了保護年幼的孩子，他在劇烈的震顫中果斷彎折背脊，用身體擋下了墜落的土石，其中尖銳的碎塊輕易刺破衣物與皮膚，陷進骨肉。\n但他絲毫未動，咬牙等待餘震止息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……"},{"type":"narration","text":"這聲嗚咽將他從劇痛的恍惚中驚醒。\n昏迷的孩子，醒來後發現自己身處昏暗而陌生的地界，因走投無路而哭泣，這是最為原始的本能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，奧利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……沒關係，沒關係，我在這裡……我是諾威爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們之前見過，你記得嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"餘震似乎停止了。諾威爾單手抱著奧利，用另一隻手慢慢支撐自己，強行抬高壓在背後的重量，跪坐起來。\n所幸那只是碎裂的石塊，並非完整厚重的石板，但血腥味仍隨著動作彌散開來，懷中的孩子只能在昏暗裡無措地搖頭。\n那個孩子幾乎什麼都看不見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……克洛維希婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她救了你……我必須先安全地帶你出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……然後我再回來……帶她出去。她應該安息的地方不在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"諾威爾跪坐著，將不斷顫抖的男孩放到地上，準備自己拔出插在背上的碎片。\n男孩伸手抓住了諾威爾的衣服。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我不是要丟下你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，我不會因為這樣就死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有什麼能殺死我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"說到這裡，男人甚至露出微笑。話語間，他的手已經摸到了插在肩胛之間的最後一枚碎片。\n諾威爾咬牙將其拔下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈……奧利，嚇到你了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，來吧。無論如何，我都會帶你出去的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"忍耐疼痛早已成為深入骨髓的習慣，諾威爾再度抱起男孩，準備沿著記憶中的原路返回，找到能讓兩人安全撤離的路線。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"過來的路……是這個方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再撐一下，奧利。我會帶你出去，你的父母就在外面等著——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（掙扎）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想下去？但我抱著你更快也更安全，難道你不想早點見到你的母親嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（跳下去）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好吧，那你緊緊跟著我，不要放手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"孩子點頭，伸出手抓住了諾威爾的衣角。他甚至無師自通地將那片衣角在自己小小的手掌中絞緊一圈，表示自己準確聽見了大人的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那我們就——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……你走過了很漫長的路……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……可憐的人……"},{"type":"narration","text":"突然，空靈的話語夾雜著回音，自殘壁四方傳來。\n在昏暗中，輕紗一般的霧氣逐漸彌散，直至將諾威爾包圍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你為何來此？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這個聲音，諾威爾永遠不會認錯。\n男人發覺自己無法動彈。陡然升起的、冰冷的憤怒，不斷衝擊著他的神智，使他停在了原地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想要什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他不知道這個聲音出現在此時此刻有什麼用意，本能的不信任凌駕於一切判斷之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停止裝神弄鬼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我以為你一直想見到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你究竟在說什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是誰？你在哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就在此處。你為我而來，我也為你而來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你只需要……睜開眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"此前，諾威爾從未得見這聲音的主人，也無法從旁確證它的樣貌。長久以來，他只能反覆拼湊那些傳言，將疑問咀嚼成怨恨。\n如果這個聲音是真實而非虛幻，那它一定……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？那麼，你一定能告訴我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我該稱呼你為有求必應的仙子，還是偉大萬能的護國公？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這隱藏在歷史背面的獨角獸，既是仙靈，也是惡徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“獨角獸”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那些都是我，也都不是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“獨角獸”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在此，只為向你，一個可憐的人，許諾一個補償。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至不知道我的名字。我的遭遇，對你這樣傳奇的存在——對你曾經攪弄的那些風雲而言，一定不值一提。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“獨角獸”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說的話並不準確。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“獨角獸”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你身上原本有我期待的可能。一株不辨品類的小草，如果永遠都不會枯萎，它會長成何種模樣，它又將如何影響四野？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“獨角獸”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我賜予你長生時所想的，本應是一個祝福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，“祝福”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你傲慢的“祝福”只為我帶來了漫長的痛苦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“獨角獸”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……這並非我的本意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但它的確變為了凌遲！而且與現實不同，你甚至不讓我真正的死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它只是——詛咒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“獨角獸”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我理解你的憤怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“獨角獸”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，我該怎麼做才會讓你好受一點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又要向我施捨你的另一個祝福了嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"諾威爾感受到孩子抓住自己衣角的力道又加重了一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧利……你能聽到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那是欺詐者的聲音，不要去聽，也不要去想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我送你離開，奧利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你是誰，去問那些隨你起舞的傳說英雄吧，我要離開這裡了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“獨角獸”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"掌舵者始終只是時代浪潮中的少數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在向我抱怨？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“獨角獸”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……既然你已將我的祝福視為詛咒，那我可以對此做出補償。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“獨角獸”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"許下願望吧，你想要什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“獨角獸”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你還有機會……你已經比常人得到了更多東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“獨角獸”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，奧利。我們已經耽擱太久了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“獨角獸”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（抓緊諾威爾的衣服）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，孩子。我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是害怕那個聲音……其實不必理會即可。如果真的是它，那也只是一個犯罪者，和那些在城裡作亂的人沒有任何區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會回來抓住它。但現在，我得先帶你出去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“獨角獸”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——是小奧利！諾威爾先生找到他了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快點，快過來幫忙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我扶著你，你先爬上去。慢一點——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，先生，我在上面接著，別擔心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來，諾威爾先生，接下來是您。您受傷了嗎？需不需要幫您？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g3_fogblockadestreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧利！哦，天，我的寶貝——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你嚇死我了！下次、下次我一定會緊緊抱著你……不會再發生這種事情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這衣服上的血是怎麼來的？你哪裡受傷了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，也沒有哪裡受傷了啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（看了看諾威爾）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧利，那個一開始就找到你的姐姐在哪裡？她是不是還在……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不在下面？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寡言的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你這個孩子……總之，平安回來就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"諾威爾先生，謝謝您——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"諾威爾看見朝自己揮手的男人臉上露出了焦急與慌亂之外的表情。\n那是感激的笑容，帶著令人感到侷促的誠摯，因此他只能點頭，然後回以微笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用……謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"但男人腳步不停，依舊向他走來，站定之後又伸出手，像是僅靠語言無以表達自己的感謝。於是諾威爾保持著笑臉，下意識地回握了。\n直到這時，他終於遲鈍地感覺到逐步擴散的疼痛，從後背，到胸前，直至全身。他因為呼吸困難而抓緊衣領，不得不彎下腰去。\n先前被碎石刺破的傷口，仍未開始癒合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃，先生，您怎麼了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊，您的背後！我不知道您受了這麼嚴重的傷——要快點找醫生處理包紮——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我都忘了，您自己就是醫生……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我受傷了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您……您背上的傷口還在流血啊？這麼大、這麼多傷口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傷口還沒有開始癒合？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的、是的。這對我們是稀鬆平常的事情，但對您來說，一定很奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在下面遇到什麼了？怎麼受了這麼嚴重的傷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，那位自救軍的領袖，似乎也還在廢墟裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也保護了奧利，或許我得向自救軍表個態，比如下去，將她的屍體帶回來……之類的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛維希婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她叫克洛維希婭？好像是這個名字。真可惜，我甚至沒能仔細地看看她的長相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說她是個偉大的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"偉大的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我不……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"克洛維希婭……原來他剛剛錯過了他窮盡一輩子去試圖尋找的人。\n但這些都已經不重要了，不再重要了。諾威爾在被疼痛和呼吸剝奪意識的間隙，努力抬起頭來。\n模糊的視線盡頭，一個孩子緊緊地抓住母親的手。那個孩子看起來很健康，暖色的頭髮與皮膚，臉上掛著笑容，簡直就像……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，先生，我扶您去找自救軍或者典範軍！他們那裡一定有軍醫……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說什麼？為什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"諾威爾先生！您——您怎麼了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撐住——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"諾威爾再也沒有力氣能夠支撐自己了，他跪了下去，委頓在地。跋涉百年的疲倦像是在這一刻全數歸返自身。\n在失血使手腳徹底失溫之前，他無視脊背上猙獰傷口的疼痛，將自己用力蜷縮起來，直至頭頂觸及地面。\n他幾乎擺出了一個可以被標記為虔誠的姿勢，卻並不為了向任何人祈求或禱告。\n片刻後，他抬起頭來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自救軍的領袖，不在廢墟裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"疼痛依然，悲哭的衝動依舊。可四周萬籟俱寂，只有一顆心臟的跳動，正在胸腔中隆隆作響。\n那個令他感到幸福、令他能夠死去的東西……已經在這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛維希婭不在那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的傷——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，比起做這些徒勞之事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諾威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1066_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我應該加快腳步，救下更多人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
